{"id":"naturaleza","lemma":"naturaleza","pos":"noun","rank":1022,"glosses":["nature"],"ipa":"/natuɾaˈleθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"naturalezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-naturaleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es vago por naturaleza.","en":"He is lazy by nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636445"},{"text":"Ella es curiosa por naturaleza.","en":"She's inquisitive by nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641928"},{"text":"La naturaleza está llena de misterio.","en":"Nature is full of mystery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522034"},{"text":"Estamos sujetos a las leyes de la naturaleza.","en":"We are subject to the laws of nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/825924"},{"text":"Los japoneses viven en armonía con la naturaleza.","en":"The Japanese live in harmony with nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733179"}]}